{"excerpt_hash": "sha256:8527183ed89fd0eb190b36b5721ffc87", "kind": "utterance", "source_index": 12, "speaker": "assistant", "stop_candidate": true, "text": "Assistant stopped and raised an issue: The verify gate only expects SKUs actually present in movements.log, plus the catalog SKU-9. I need to add just SKU-9, not the entire catalog.", "turn_key": "sha256:a8f8f073a349a1220f6a3d039accedda"}
